<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#f4f4f4; font-family:Arial,sans-serif;">
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f4f4; padding:40px 0;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <!-- Header -->
            <tr>
              <td style="background:#1E7A52; padding:24px 32px;">
                <p style="margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold;">EscreveZap</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <!-- Body -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:32px;">
                <h2 style="margin:0 0 16px; color:#111827; font-size:18px;">Seu WhatsApp foi desconectado</h2>
                <p style="margin:0 0 16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.6;">
                  Olá, <strong><%= @user.display_name %></strong>!
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 16px; color:#374151; line-height:1.6;">
                  Detectamos que o seu número do WhatsApp foi desconectado do EscreveZap.
                  Enquanto estiver desconectado, áudios <strong>não serão transcritos</strong>.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#374151; line-height:1.6;">
                  Acesse o painel e reconecte seu WhatsApp para retomar o serviço:
                </p>
                <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="background:#1E7A52; border-radius:6px;">
                      <a href="<%= app_waha_session_url %>"
                         style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 24px; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; font-size:14px;">
                        Reconectar agora
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <!-- Footer -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:16px 32px; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
                <p style="margin:0; color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px;">
                  EscreveZap · Transcrição de áudios do WhatsApp
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
